-- Rules of Court 2021 (Singapore), G.N. No. S 914/2021, current version as at 5 November 2026.
-- ORDER 68: VARIABLE CAPITAL COMPANIES ACT 2018 (part roc12, layer 1).
-- Source: a plain-text rendering made by a converter script from Singapore Statutes Online.
-- It is not the official text, and nothing here has been checked against the official text.
-- The Variable Capital Companies Act 2018 and the Companies Act are not among the sources: what they say is a fact the asker states.
--
-- HOW TO READ A RESULT.  Every decision function answers `MAYBE BOOLEAN`.
--   JUST TRUE    the thing holds as the Order states it.
--   JUST FALSE   the Order says no in its own words (a "means" definition not met, a "where" or "unless" condition not met).
--   NOTHING      the Order does not answer: it is silent, it limits a grant by its own wording, a bare "must"
--                has not been done, or the answer lives in an Act that is not among the sources.
-- A caller must never turn NOTHING into FALSE.


